{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1000_p", "source_sha256": "633f77fe969114274d94c48be36d7fd79a083b90d7860fa926bcc746c20dbc27", "ja": "（今日は雑誌の撮影だ。麗花は楽しそうに凧あげを\nしていたが、糸が切れて凧が飛んで行ってしまった）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄杂志照片。丽花刚才还开心地放风筝，可风筝线断了，风筝飞走了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "133c0ac761222a5af736a775a42a5e4e5ed8067e125a5d36eda2de20c24753c8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしました。\n着替え、終わりましたよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让您久等了。\n我已经换好衣服了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1002_p", "source_sha256": "30036b5936604d32d3a5bdab391ceb197d30438c34d8aafb8943388cfd1543c7", "ja": "麗花、お疲れさま。今日の撮影は大変だったな。\nまさか凧が飛んで行っちゃうとは……。", "zh": "丽花，辛苦了。今天的拍摄真够辛苦的。没想到风筝居然飞走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "0036040e64e710c5f440f14679fa083e856cfb76d564aea692aa6faf82e78674", "ja": "ビックリしましたね。もしかして、あのタコさん……\n自由になりたかったのかな？", "zh": "真让人吃惊呢。难道那只风筝……是想获得自由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "f1f361a09983d737009ef3f4881bd9c41a71d15bd9aec0b0182c11f7ac2855b8", "ja": "お空をぷかぷかーって、泳ぎたかったのかも！\nどこまで行ったんだろう。もう月まで届いたかな～？", "zh": "也许它只是想在天空中飘啊飘地游泳吧！\n不知道它游到哪里去了。现在已经飘到月亮那里了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4fe7c9019f50eccc10426edf439502099246191c56cac82bf7891a910cde9a5e", "ja": "月に行けるかはわからないけど……。\n今頃気持ちよさそうに飛んでるかもしれないな。", "zh": "能不能飞到月亮上就不知道了……\n说不定现在正飞得舒舒服坦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "ec855864395a58feeb9323032aa11250b51e915ad80b998de3d9ad700d761f7c", "ja": "いいないいな～。空を越えて、雲を越えて！\n虹の向こうまでハイキングですね♪", "zh": "好羡慕好羡慕～。越过天空，越过云朵！一直徒步到彩虹的另一边呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "7260597bc419e95f5b83d1aa813d8cb912bcef24812d914a85f20e785bd6ae8c", "ja": "でも、ひとりで大丈夫かな？\n気になるので、私、様子を見に行ってみますね！", "zh": "不过，一个人真的没问题吗？\n我有点在意，所以去看看情况吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1008_p", "source_sha256": "45c78bf2219bfcbd004469501b0712325ddb49b5186f37e41a431939f7d87feb", "ja": "えっ？\n様子を見るって……あっ、麗花！", "zh": "咦？\n你说要去看看情况……啊，丽花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1010_p", "source_sha256": "221a4118d16cb47a11ecb3995a36e104f896370a0b1e5489847284f11279a2d6", "ja": "ゼー、ゼー……。\nど、どこまで行くんだ、麗花？", "zh": "呼、呼……。\n还要跑到哪里去啊，丽花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "a52c19d1bbbdecb2f50ecdc698c85323d31a765464bd00a96e2cb55509d98186", "ja": "会えるまで頑張ろうかなって思ったんですけど……\n大丈夫ですか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "我本来想着要努力到见到它为止……不过，您还好吗，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "08ce559b4536ebe8b8e03f3deca22d45c52c6a172f982a457069a85ad05df2af", "ja": "うーん……タコさん、全然見えないですね。\n足が多いから、逃げ足も早いのかな～？", "zh": "嗯……章鱼先生，完全看不见呢。\n是不是因为脚多，所以逃跑也很快呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f3fa72be8f1cde1dfaaf1969bd1257d943d6ae546bd11d4257966679e801eaf3", "ja": "ははっ、そうかもしれないな。\n麗花が会いたいと願えば、またどこかで会えるさ。", "zh": "哈哈，也许真是这样。\n只要丽花想见它，就一定还能在某个地方再见到它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "703b06fdfea49d22f3724b0891b921a272168dbcecdcb869842e9ce3828204b1", "ja": "私が願えば……。わかりました！\nそれじゃ、今度ブログにタコさんのことを書きますね！", "zh": "只要我许愿……。明白了！\n那下次我在博客上写写章鱼先生的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1809ab6700ab795c9bc0d547e1dde5298217515daeee5d9c8eb86fceb4a6571e", "ja": "ブログに？　そうだな。\nもしかしたら、誰かが見つけてくれるかもしれない。", "zh": "写进博客？嗯，也对。\n说不定会有人发现它呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "62a7714ceea94480514f65bf03b45cc96f8389bbab9bb6a6a37fd0cc2304eefc", "ja": "はい、タコさん大捜索ですね！　再会したら、\nお空の大冒険を聞いてみたいな～。ふふっ♪", "zh": "是的，要大规模寻找章鱼先生呢！等再见到它时，真想听听它在天空中的大冒险～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2c80284eb9d9de8f54ebfe2a48f4a5b330cbdb4a9aecc3629d7dbdef542708e2", "ja": "ああ。……おっと、もうこんな時間か。\nそろそろ劇場に戻ろう、麗花。", "zh": "啊……糟糕，已经这么晚了。\n差不多该回剧场了，丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0273_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "9557d4dd95bb86d15cbc8e3626f7f4a954e88f700aca93be0453b9b899492975", "ja": "はーい！　風に乗って、ビューンと帰りましょう、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "好——！乘着风，嗖地一下回剧场吧，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
